{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29235","headline":"岁暮自广江至新兴往复中题峡山寺四首 二 · 许浑","name":"岁暮自广江至新兴往复中题峡山寺四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄暮缘西峡，停桡一访僧。\n鹭巢横卧柳，猨饮倒垂藤。\n水曲岩千叠，云重树百层。\n山风寒殿磬，溪雨夜船灯。\n滩涨危槎没，泉冲怪石崩。\n中台一襟泪，岁杪别良朋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}